{"sections":[{"slug":"小平嵌入定理","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"小平嵌入定理"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">小平嵌入定理</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“小平嵌入定理”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $(M,L)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/极化流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">极化流形</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则存在足够大的正整数</span> $k_0$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得对</span> $k\\geq k_0$, <span lang=\"zh\">如下映射是嵌入</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">令</span> $N = \\dim H^0(M,L^k)$, <span lang=\"zh\">任取</span> $L^k$ <span lang=\"zh\">的全纯截面</span> $s_0,\\cdots,s_N$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\n\\Phi_{L^k}\\colon M\\to \\mathbb P^N(\\mathbb{C}),p\\mapsto (s_0(p):\\cdots: s_N(p)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">推论</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上存在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/正线丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">正线丛</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数簇","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数簇</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}